{# Default requirement template (DESIGN.md §6.3, T04).
   Deliberately close to the canonical schema so the mapping is near-identity
   at first. Replace this file, not ppa/ledger/models.py, to adopt a
   different house style. #}
# {{ terminology.requirement }} {{ requirement.id }}

**Statement:** {{ requirement.statement }}

- **Type:** {{ requirement.type }}
- **Status:** {{ requirement.status }}
- **Confidence:** {{ requirement.confidence }} ({{ requirement.confidence_basis }})
- **Priority:** {{ requirement.priority }}

**Covers areas:** {{ requirement.covers_areas | join(", ") if requirement.covers_areas else "—" }}
**Derived from:** {{ requirement.derived_from_answers | join(", ") if requirement.derived_from_answers else "—" }}
**Depends on:** {{ (requirement.depends_on_assumptions + requirement.depends_on_decisions) | join(", ") if (requirement.depends_on_assumptions + requirement.depends_on_decisions) else "—" }}

{% if requirement.custom_fields -%}
**Custom fields:**
{% for key, value in requirement.custom_fields.items() -%}
- {{ key }}: {{ value }}
{% endfor -%}
{% else -%}
**Custom fields:** {}
{% endif -%}
